{"id": "70518", "title": "军门闪婚", "author": "蓝缪", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 20, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70518/70518s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70518.htm", "intro": "第一次见到这个女人的时候，她挽着一个快要入土的老头笑靥如花；\n    第二次遇到她的时候，她穿着护士服和一个男人眉来眼去；\n    第三次再见，她出现在他的对面，成为他的相亲对象！\n    关凌朝，当今太子爷，部队中优秀军官，因长辈威胁逼婚，无奈相亲，却遇百变女郎；\n    她是行动组中唯一的女性，因特殊身份，乔装打扮混迹各色人群各种声色场所，不料身份外泄之时，她遇到了他；\n    他说：我需要一个妻子，你很合适。\n    对付家里那一群虎视眈眈的长辈，她应该应付自如。\n    她说：好，我嫁，我需要一个家。\n    一个高干权贵的家庭，足以成为她的护身之地。\n    这样没有真情也没有真心的两个人，会擦出怎样的火花？", "base": "files/article/html/70/70518", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10996728.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10996729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10996730.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10996731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10996732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10996733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10996734.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-57", "file": "10996735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "58-61", "file": "10996736.html", "available": true}, {"title": "62-64", "file": "10996737.html", "available": true}, {"title": "65-67", "file": "10996738.html", "available": true}, {"title": "68-69", "file": "10996739.html", "available": true}, {"title": "70-71", "file": "10996740.html", "available": true}, {"title": "72-76", "file": "10996741.html", "available": true}, {"title": "77-81", "file": "10996742.html", "available": true}, {"title": "82-85", "file": "10996743.html", "available": true}, {"title": "86-92", "file": "10996744.html", "available": true}, {"title": "93-97", "file": "10996745.html", "available": true}, {"title": "98-103", "file": "10996746.html", "available": true}, {"title": "104-109完结", "file": "10996747.html", "available": true}]}